# Machine-specific dev-server launch config (absolute interpreter/project
# paths) -- every machine needs its own, so this is intentionally
# per-machine rather than shared/overwritten on every push. See
# HANDOVER.md's "Environment" section for what to put in a fresh one.
.claude/launch.json
static/photos/*
!static/photos/.gitkeep
